{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oops! A monkey has stolen your blown-out wig.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want to make it to your blind date tonight, use your umbrella to defeat the wind and obstacles and get your wig back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/extras/umbrella-3.png?t=1749604243\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/extras/\uc6b0\uc0b0GIF.gif?t=1749604243\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control your umbrella as it flails in the wind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful, it will fly backwards if you leave a certain angle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/extras/umbrella-4.png?t=1749604243\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/extras/\uc7a5\uc560\ubb3cGIF.gif?t=1749604243\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump over the many obstacles that stand in your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It won't be easy, but you can do it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/extras/umbrella-5.png?t=1749604243\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/extras/\uc801GIF.gif?t=1749604243\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monkeys and monkey-obsessed villains stand in your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face a variety of terrain and enemy patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/extras/umbrella-6.png?t=1749604243\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/extras/\uc544\uc774\ud15cGIF.gif?t=1749604243\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't worry, you're not alone! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each time you reach a certain distance, you'll be rewarded with a powerful item.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3678760?t=1749604243","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3678760?t=1749604243","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/90b2b0a54bff7eae2bc102443c4a6fe2cfd79156/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749604243","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/90b2b0a54bff7eae2bc102443c4a6fe2cfd79156/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749604243","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3795300,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oops! A monkey has stolen your blown-out wig.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want to make it to your blind date tonight, use your umbrella to defeat the wind and obstacles and get your wig back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/extras/umbrella-3.png?t=1749604243\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/extras/\uc6b0\uc0b0GIF.gif?t=1749604243\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control your umbrella as it flails in the wind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful, it will fly backwards if you leave a certain angle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akama